| 1   |                                 | NTS | <structDecl>                    | 103  | 0  | 2  |
| 2   |                                 | NTS | <unionDecl>                     | 113  | 0  | 3  |
| 3   |                                 | NTS | <typedefDecl>                   | 134  | 0  | 4  |
| 4   |                                 | NTS | <enumDecl>                      | 90   | 0  | 5  |
| 5   |                                 | NTS | <externDecl>                    | 67   | 0  | 6  |
| 6   |                                 | NTS | <funcdef>                       | 235  | 0  | 7  |
| 7   |                                 | NTS | <defosDecl>                     | 64   | 0  | 8  |
| 8   |                                 | NTS | <defmodulEntryDecl>             | 18   | 0  | 9  |
| 9   |                                 | NTS | <defmodulDecl>                  | 10   | 0  | T  |
+-----+---------------------------------+-----+---------------------------------+------+----+----+
| 10  | <defmodulDecl>                  | TS  | "#defmodul"                     | -    | 11 | F  |
| 11  |                                 | NTS | <defmodulName>                  | 24   | T  | 12 |
| 12  |                                 | NTS | <defmodulEdition>               | 30   | T  | 13 |
| 13  |                                 | NTS | <defmodulStack>                 | 33   | T  | 14 |
| 14  |                                 | NTS | <defmodulAttr>                  | 36   | T  | 15 |
| 15  |                                 | NTS | <defmodulType>                  | 39   | T  | 16 |
| 16  |                                 | NTS | <defmodulNotImpl>               | 60   | T  | 17 |
| 17  |                                 | NTS | <defmodulUnknown>               | 63   | T  | E  |
+-----+---------------------------------+-----+---------------------------------+------+----+----+
| 18  | <defmodulEntryDecl>             | TS  | "#defmodul"                     | -    | 19 | F  |
| 19  |                                 | TS  | "ENTRY"                         | -    | 20 | E  |
| 20  |                                 | NTS | <ident>                         | 841  | 21 | E  |
| 21  |                                 | NTS | <defmodulEntryTarget>           | 22   | T  | E  |
+-----+---------------------------------+-----+---------------------------------+------+----+----+
| 22  | <defmodulEntryTarget>           | NTS | <ident>                         | 841  | T  | 23 |
| 23  |                                 | NTS | <defmodulNumber>                | 27   | T  | F  |
